t past ruling's code&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#1f2933;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="n13"><mxGeometry x="30" y="282" width="540" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value='&lt;b&gt;4 · Adjudicator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#5f6b76"&gt;one Bedrock call picks among real codes, with similar rulings as context&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d3efe9;strokeColor=#01A88D;fontColor=#1f2933;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="n13"><mxGeometry x="30" y="396" width="540" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value='&lt;b&gt;5 · Classification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#5f6b76"&gt;a real HTS leaf · alternatives · fast-track flag when all sources agree&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#1f2933;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="n13"><mxGeometry x="30" y="510" width="540" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value='&lt;b&gt;Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:10px" color="#5f6b76"&gt;512-d vectors · Bedrock&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#1f2933;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=56;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="164" width="300" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#1f2933;fillColor=#01A88D;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.bedrock;" vertex="1" parent="n19"><mxGeometry x="248" y="16" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value='&lt;b&gt;Ruling index&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&